            <ArticleTitle>Giant coronary artery aneurysms in Kawasaki disease: the cost of a missed diagnosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>608-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1017/S1047951112002338</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Giant coronary aneurysms secondary to Kawasaki disease are rare, but a very severe complication. Delayed diagnosis and appropriate treatment of the disease is a well-known risk factor for coronary aneurysms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
